  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Stop causing object to point at a target</p>
  <p>Use in conjunction <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlLookAt" target="_blank">llLookAt</a> or <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlRotLookAt" target="_blank">llRotLookAt</a>.</p>
</p>
    </div>

